                                "sense_id": "55640230-f765-3690-becc-fc86b89ec107",
                                "text": "And many a sheeny summer-morn, / Adown the Tigris I was borne, / By Bagdat's shrines of fretted gold, / High-walled gardens green and old; […]"
                            }
                        ]
